                        "explanation": "<p> (a) ____ so; (b) ____ that; (c) ____ and; (d) ____ But; (e) ____ until; (f) ____ and; (g) ____ as; (h) ____ Also/Moreover; (i) ____ But; (j) ____ So; (k) ____ and; (1) when; (m) ____ But; (n) ____ As a result</p>"
