                        "explanation": "<p> (a) ____ such as/like; (b) ____ Moreover; (c) ____ Besides; (d) ____ not only/both; (e) ____ but also/and; (f) ____ So/Therefore; (g) ____ However; (h) ____ indeed/actually/really; (i) ____ but; (j) ____ Firstly/At first; (k) ____ that; (l) ____ Secondly; (m) ____ who; (n) ____ Finally/Above all.</p>"
