                        "explanation": "<p> (a) ____ For example; (b) ____ As; (c) ____ When; (d) ____ which; (e) ____ That's why; (f) ____ when; (g) ____ Moreover; (h) ____ Besides; (i) ____ However; (j) ____ In fact/Actually; (k) ____ but; (l) ____ but/though; m) Rather/Instead; (n) ____ Furthermore.</p>"
