                        "explanation": "<p>(a) ____ that; (b) ____ In fact/Actually/ Truly speaking/True that; (c) ____ For example; (d) ____ like/such as; (e) ____ as/since/because; (f) ____ like/such as; (g) ____ rather; (h) ____ So/Therefore; (i) ____ that/which; (j) ____ also. </p>"
