                        "explanation": "<p>(a) ____ common/general/simple; (b) ____ weak/powerless; (c) ____ people/mankind/humankind; (d) ____ unreliable; (e) ____ insignificant/worthless; (f) ____ ceremony/custom; (g) ____ useless/ valueless/ insignificant; (h) ____ solitude/isolation/solitariness/ aloneness; (i) ____ sickness/disease; (j) ____ sorrow/ unhappiness misery. </p>"
