                        "explanation": "<p>(a) ____ And/That is why; (b) ____ So/Therefore; (c) ____ Instead/Rather; (d) ____ Particularly/Especially; (e) ____ In this way/Thus; (f) ____ Consequently/As a result; (g) ____ So/That's why; (h) ____ As a result/Accordingly; (i) ____ Yet; (j) ____ Rather. </p>"
