                        "question": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Write a paragraph on 'The Impact of Facebook on Young Generation' within 200 words</span></strong></p>",
                        "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">                 <strong>The Impact of Facebook on Young Generation </strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Facebook is arguably one of the greatest and the most wonderful inventions of modern technology. It is a social networking website intended to connect friends, family, and business associates. Users are able to search for friends and acquaintances by e-mail address, school, university, or just by typing a name or location for search. So, needless to say, it is very popular among the young generation, The impact of using Facebook is both positive and negative. On the positive side, it is a great medium for communication. Young people can easily stay connected to their friends and family around the world. It helps create stronger bonds and improve their social skills. They can also engage with educational contents and stay up to date with the recent news. However, concerns arise when they become addicted to it and start to spend more time online. The lack of concentration on studying hampers their academic performance. Again, sometimes privacy is not ensured for which few immoral people post obscene pictures. Seeing these pictures, the tender minds of the youngsters are severely damaged. Besides, various crimes are being held through it. Many incidents of cyberbullying, fraud schemes and hacking have come to light over the years. Despite the few bad sides of Facebook, it has great importance for the communication in modern era. So, we<br/>12. all should take all possible steps so that this blessing may not turn into a curse.</p>"
